# Defensive: any private-key file shape, in case one ever ends up
# inside the repo dir by accident. Keys are recommended to live in the
# home directory (see SETUP.md key-pair auth section); these patterns
# are belt-and-suspenders.
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

